=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Saddle up! Collect equipment and magical baubles to boost your party's stats and unlock new skills in battle! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Meet a cast of 100's of cool, cute and crude characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting 6-chapter adventure awaits in <strong>Reindeer Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reindeer Story</strong> draws inspiration from a varied set of classic and modern RPGs including Paper Mario, Mario &amp; Luigi, Final Fantasy 1-9 and Deltarune. It will feature a 10+ hour main story line, New Game+ and a lot of optional content and secrets to uncover that will give you reasons to keep coming back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say the story of the red nose reindeer captured the hearts of millions... This game is a fun and surprising adventure that will be great to play every Winter as a tradition!</p>","developers":["Azzie","Smoggysoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946170/header.jpg?t=1759507609","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1946170/664400/c6a5e029545f59fcabd8a02fc731a5128bf95aff/1751052114/dash_av1.mpd?t=1713095231","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1946170/664400/c6a5e029545f59fcabd8a02fc731a5128bf95aff/1751052114/dash_h264.mpd?t=1713095231","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1946170/664400/c6a5e029545f59fcabd8a02fc731a5128bf95aff/1751052114/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1713095231","id":257002128,"name":"Reindeer Story - Release Date Trailer!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257002128/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1713095231"}],"name":"Reindeer Story"